---
/**
 * Tokens lesson — illustration #1 of 3.
 *
 * The text-to-integers pipeline. Hand-authored SVG.
 *
 * Why hand SVG, not Mermaid:
 *   No Mermaid integration in the build yet, and the diagram needs the
 *   "the model only ever sees this" bracket-and-caption flourish that
 *   Mermaid doesn't render cleanly. Pilot for the illustrations approach
 *   per the 2026-04-28 design conversation.
 *
 * Theme:
 *   currentColor for borders, text, and arrows; one accent (violet 600)
 *   for the highlight on the "integer ID" box and the model-only-sees
 *   bracket. Renders correctly in both Starlight light and dark themes.
 */
---

<figure class="cw-illus">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 800 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="pipeline-title pipeline-desc">
		<title id="pipeline-title">From raw text to model input</title>
		<desc id="pipeline-desc">A horizontal four-stage pipeline. Raw text (the word "strawberry") enters a tokenizer. The tokenizer outputs an integer ID. The integer ID is what the model receives. The model never sees the original letters; it only ever sees the ID and what comes after it.</desc>
		<defs>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-1" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor"/>
			</marker>
		</defs>
		<rect x="10" y="50" width="160" height="80" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="90" y="85" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">"strawberry"</text>
		<text x="90" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6">raw text</text>
		<line x1="180" y1="90" x2="208" y2="90" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-1)"/>
		<rect x="220" y="50" width="160" height="80" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="300" y="85" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">tokenizer</text>
		<text x="300" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6">vocabulary lookup</text>
		<line x1="390" y1="90" x2="418" y2="90" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-1)"/>
		<rect x="430" y="50" width="160" height="80" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2"/>
		<text x="510" y="87" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="20" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="600">73700</text>
		<text x="510" y="110" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6">integer ID</text>
		<line x1="600" y1="90" x2="628" y2="90" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-1)"/>
		<rect x="640" y="50" width="150" height="80" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="715" y="85" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">model</text>
		<text x="715" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6">attention, layers</text>
		<path d="M 430 158 L 430 168 L 790 168 L 790 158" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="610" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#7c3aed" font-style="italic">the model only ever sees this</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>The tokenization pipeline. Text becomes integer IDs before the model touches it. Everything to the right of the tokenizer is the only world the model knows.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cw-illus {
		margin: 1.75rem auto;
		max-width: 100%;
	}
	.cw-illus svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 780px;
		height: auto;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.cw-illus figcaption {
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		opacity: 0.75;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-style: italic;
	}
</style>
